<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SUNCRUSH DETAILS CAPITALISATION AWARD.</title>
<headline>SUNCRUSH DETAILS CAPITALISATION AWARD.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suncrush Ltd said on Monday it would award capitalisation shares to shareholders on register on September 13.</p>
<p>The new shares would be issued in the ratio that 17.5 cents multiplied by 1.05 cents bears to the average closing price of Suncrush ordinary shares on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange for the four days ending October 17.</p>
<p>Shar276ders may elect to receive a 17.5 cents cash dividend insteadn</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
